      "name": "Director's Magic",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "concentrate",
        "spellshape"
      ],
      "text": "Fallenta weaves her spellcasting into director's instructions. If the next action she uses is to Cast a Spell, the spell gains the subtle trait, although the spell's effects appear as normal. As part of using Director's Magic, Fallenta can choose to Create a Diversion, Lie, Perform, or Request. If she does so, the spell she casts must have the auditory, emotion, sonic, or visual trait to gain the subtle trait."
